### 1. List Products (Paginated, Searchable, Filterable)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products?page=1&limit=10&sortBy=createdAt&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 2. Search Products by Keyword (matches name, SKU, category)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products?q=DRILL
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 3. Get Low Stock Alert Products (currentStock <= minStockAlert)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 4. Create New Product
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cordless Screwdriver 12V",
  "sku": "SCREWDRIVE-12V",
  "category": "Power Tools",
  "unitPrice": 1850.00,
  "currentStock": 30,
  "minStockAlert": 5,
  "location": "Aisle 4 - Shelf A"
}

### 5. Get Product Detail with Movement History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/<PRODUCT_ID>
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 6. Update Product (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/<PRODUCT_ID>
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitPrice": 1950.00,
  "minStockAlert": 10
}

### 7. Log Stock IN Movement (+50 stock)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/<PRODUCT_ID>/stock-movements
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movementType": "IN",
  "quantityChanged": 50,
  "reason": "New shipment received from supplier invoice #SUP-2026-88"
}

### 8. Log Stock OUT Movement (-10 stock)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/<PRODUCT_ID>/stock-movements
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movementType": "OUT",
  "quantityChanged": 10,
  "reason": "Damaged goods stock adjustment"
}

### 9. Test Insufficient Stock OUT Movement (Attempt to remove 9999 units)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/<PRODUCT_ID>/stock-movements
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movementType": "OUT",
  "quantityChanged": 9999,
  "reason": "Excessive deduction test"
}

### 10. Get Stock Movement History for Product
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/<PRODUCT_ID>/stock-movements
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
